  m_text: "Tags: \r\n\t- High protein \r\n\t- Lean \r\nHealth Advice: \r\nChicken
    Satay is healthy & high in protein, especially when grilled. \r\nThe main watch
    would be the peanut sauce & portion control. This dish \r\nwould make a good
    resistance training post workout meal.\n\nPortions    Calories      Protein    
    Carbs      Fats\n      1 \t        265  \t      34g   \t   8             9g\n     
    2 \t        530  \t      69g   \t   16g         18g\n      3          795  \t     
    103g   \t   24g         27g\n      4          1060  \t      138g    \t   32g        
    36g\n      5          1325  \t      172g    \t   40g         45g"
